<title>SPAIN: Gas Natural to invest in Latin America.</title>
<headline>Gas Natural to invest in Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish gas supplier Gas Natural will invest 76.0 billion pesetas in Latin American projects over the next five years, sources at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>This outlay will be aimed at developing business in Argentina, Brazil, Colombia and Mexico.</p>
<p>This figure is part of a five year 90 billion peseta investment plan, announced earlier this month, and may be revised up before the end of the year.</p>
</text>
